{
  "name": "bikefit-angles",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Bike fit joint angles from 2D pose landmarks: knee, torso, elbow, shoulder and hip, bottom-of-stroke detection, per-bike-type targets and green/amber/red grading. The measuring core of Bike Fit Analyzer.",
